    "title": "Threat made toward Fort Washakie school deemed 'unfounded' by Wind River PD, FBI - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Vince Tropea ,\n5 hours ago (Fort Washakie, WY) – On the evening of May 19, screenshot images of a text thread made their rounds on social media, which showed messages containing a shooting threat directed at a Fort Washakie school. School administration and law enforcement were later made aware of the threats, and, as a precaution, Fort Washakie schools began with a one-hour delay today, May 20. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
